Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Uninstall — removes the uBO force-install policy for Edge. Run elevated, restart Edge.
; Deletes only uBO's entry; other ExtensionSettings policies stay.
; Managed-device step is separate — run fake-mdm-undo.reg to undo that.

